assets/enemies/{enemy_id}/animations/{death_hash}/{dir}/frame_NNN.png
```
- carrot_goblin 예시: `assets/enemies/carrot_goblin/animations/dying-{hash}/south/frame_000.png`
- 방향: 4방향(`south`, `north`, `east`, `west`) 또는 8방향 — PixelLab 생성 결과에 따름
