기존: `_drawConnections()`, `_drawNodes()` — CHAPTERS 전역 참조
변경: `_drawConnections(chapters)`, `_drawNodes(chapters)` — 매개변수로 전달

- `_drawConnections(chapters)`: CONNECTIONS → SEASON_CONNECTIONS, 6개 노드 기준
- `_drawNodes(chapters)`: chapters + NODE_POSITIONS(동일 6좌표) + this._chapterStates

